## Third-party components this build carries or points at — verified 2026-10-12

Every licence below was asked of the component's own source (GitHub licence API) rather than copied
from memory; the fetch scripts name the same licence where they pull the binary. Nothing copyleft is
BUNDLED in this kit: GPL and AGPL components are separate programs the operator installs and this kit
drives over HTTP, which is why the two lists are kept apart.

